                "headline": "Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 4:31AM EDT until September 27 at 6:00AM EDT by NWS Upton NY",
                "description": "* WHAT...North winds 20 to 25 mph with gusts up to 55 mph\nexpected.\n\n* WHERE...Portions of southern Connecticut and southeast New\nYork.\n\n* WHEN...From 2 PM Friday to 6 AM EDT Sunday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree\nlimbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.",
